/* Menu and screenshot setup */
"Let Snapline handle your screenshots?" = "让 Snapline 接管系统截图吗？";
"Screenshots will hang on the line the instant you take them, without the floating thumbnail, and will not pile up on your Desktop. Drag one to a folder to keep it, or discard it with the cross. You can turn this off from the menu bar, and your settings come back when Snapline quits." = "截图后会立即挂到晾衣绳上，不再显示悬浮缩略图，也不会堆在桌面。可以将截图拖入文件夹保存，或点击叉号丢弃。你可以随时在菜单栏关闭此功能；退出 Snapline 后，系统截图设置会恢复原状。";
